{"material_id":"mat_31930667cce6","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"ad6k5zphfq44bxu1y7tb8t0ng","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","author_followers":null,"title":"Semafor：部分 Nvidia 董事仍推动让黄仁勋回归，尽管董事长否认","excerpt":"Semafor 报道称，尽管 Nvidia 董事长 Harvey Jones 表示董事会一致接受黄仁勋的辞职且无意让他复任 CEO，部分董事仍在推动其回归。黄仁勋在周二财报发布前与至少 1 名董事讨论过回归事宜；该投票仅针对辞职本身，Nvidia 章程允许剩余 10 名董事以简单多数任命 CEO 而无需股东投票。另有董事将人选范围缩小至 Arm CEO Rene Haas 和 Marvell CEO Matt Murphy 等候选人。","source_url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2122922693662245298","canonical_url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2122922693662245298","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:19:46.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-11-18T08:18:38.697Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["actionable_update","ai_news"],"relevance_score":35,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":60,"fingerprint":"31930667cce6e0ac75a176d4c403e4549a23c72d92cbc190a1b9e3cc0b322d6a","content_fingerprint":"edd6cc40e76d417447dcae1394a14c933ae2160c97545bf9325f57dc6b1508a3"}
{"material_id":"mat_e9e2faae93f5","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"znj4uw6kr9vt4uij9fmao9p00","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","author_followers":null,"title":"Nvidia 临时 CEO Colette Kress 表示董事会不会恢复黄仁勋的 CEO 职务","excerpt":"Nvidia 临时 CEO Colette Kress 在 Jim Cramer 的节目上表示，董事会已决定不会恢复黄仁勋（Jensen）的 CEO 职务，称这就是董事会的决定和官方声明。此前董事 Harvey Jones 在昨天的首次财报电话会上表示，董事会一致接受其辞职且无意让其复任。完整采访见 CNBC Mad Money，完整视频见 CNBC Television YouTube 频道。","source_url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2122925474485870983","canonical_url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2122925474485870983","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:30:49.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-11-18T08:18:38.697Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news","content_and_video"],"relevance_score":40,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":63,"fingerprint":"e9e2faae93f5831267c50f9e081b774b96bf8136c8586339fbea7fd91132665a","content_fingerprint":"68f64c938b22345797c6c137add894fff068f7631d2a643e9ac03e72e7fdd43f"}
